  "fixes_validated": [
    "Recorder state, counters, queues and encoder resources reset between recordings, including error recovery.",
    "External process output drained while running and after exit, bounded to 1 MiB to avoid pipe deadlock and truncated diagnostics.",
    "MKV timestamps normalized to exact 30 FPS during stream-copy MP4 remux; B-frame order preserved.",
    "FFprobe checks nominal/average frame rates, frame count, limited range and strict finite duration, rejecting NaN.",
    "Source window existence checked during sampling and WGC stopped on the control thread on every CLI exit.",
    "CLI HWND suffixes and non-MP4 destinations rejected; recording errors return promptly with diagnostics."
  ],
